RcppLDGM is distributed under GPL (>= 3).

The implementation is an R/Rcpp port informed by the MIT-licensed upstream
`ldgm` project (<https://github.com/awohns/ldgm>) and `graphld` project
(<https://github.com/oclb/graphld>). The package also vendors the MIT-licensed
`tskit` C API (<https://github.com/tskit-dev/tskit>) for native `.trees` file
I/O. Original copyright notices are preserved in the repository file
`LICENSE.upstream.md`.

